    {
        "content": "<p>Actually it's even simpler: in Aaron's solution, the last line could just be</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">matchAlt</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
